        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported low back pain characteristics"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Longstanding chronic intermittent dull central low back ache, possibly extending into both buttocks, without clear leg radiation. Worsened over the last 5–6 days after helping grandchildren with wood; patient thinks he may have twisted incorrectly. Worse with bending and twisting and in the evenings; eased by curling up. More stiff in the morning."
      }
    },
